  "scope": "Post-impact grounded residual horizontal knockback, with recorded traction on original host fighters 0 and 1 through production advance. Seven tech frames and three missed-tech frames; no new roster identity.",
  "limitations": [
    "NTSC flag does not identify disc revision or prove unmodified NTSC 1.02 gameplay.",
    "Seeds are recorded after impact. The original airborne root before impact differs from its collision hull; this fixture does not test original collision geometry or tech-input timing.",
    "The test-only profile supplies Captain Falcon traction; other actor values are inactive during this bounded grounded comparison. It is not a full Captain Falcon movement rig.",
    "miscActionState is action-specific and is retained only as raw telemetry, not asserted as hitstun. The change does not establish floor-recovery hitstun semantics.",
    "Original seed selfVelocityY is stale on impact; vertical collision epsilon and that stored value are not compared.",
    "Missed-tech excerpt ends at frame 958. Frame 959 leaves the original platform and changes decay; that platform shape and departure transition are not modeled by this fixture.",
    "Effective flat-ground decay equals traction in these frames; raw common multiplier +0x200 remains unextracted.",
    "Tech-roll root travel, recovery completion, platform edges and native Warcraft execution are outside the recorded comparison."
  ],
